  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building an Advanced Livestock Ecosystem Based on BIT to Strengthen the Low-Carbon Capacity of Tanzania&apos;s Dairy Industry</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Distribution of improved and feeding management models for structural improvement of Tanzania dairy industry, reducing carbon emissions intensity and improving value chains of livestock products from small-scale livestock farmers in Pwani Region&#xc120;&#xc9c4; &#xcd95;&#xc0b0;&#xc5c5; &#xc778;&#xd504;&#xb77c; &#xad6c;&#xcd95;, &#xd0c4;&#xc790;&#xb2c8;&#xc544;&#xd615; &#xad50;&#xc7a1;&#xc885; &#xc0dd;&#xc0b0;&#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xb9c8;&#xb828;, &#xd604;&#xc9c0; &#xcd95;&#xc0b0; &#xad00;&#xacc4;&#xc790; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive high capacity livestock genetic resources, locally customized TMRproduction and sales,By introducing high-capacity livestock genetic resources, the farmers in Pwani region can produce superior crossbreeds. And by supplying local customized TMR, the farmers can increase the raw milk production of their Tanzanian dairy cows,Establish an inclusive high-capacity livestock genetic resource production system by selecting and purchasing cattle with high genetic capacity from among superior crossbreds produced by local farms verified through genome analysis.Develop locally customized TMR mixing program and distribute it to local partners to support a sustainable TMR production and sales system centered on the infrastructure of the local partners. High-capacity livestock genetic resources, local customized TMR distribution,strengthening of value chain, and profit generation</narrative>
  </description>
